# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Financial Contagion Monitor v2 — .gitignore
# M.S. Ramaiah Institute of Technology | AIP67 | 2026
# WARNING: Missing entries here = security failure. Review before every push.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── SECURITY — NEVER COMMIT THESE ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials.txt
data/security/users.db
data/security/audit.log

# ── Generated Data Files (too large for GitHub, recreated by main.py) ─────────
data/raw/banks_daily_data.csv
data/raw/sri_series.csv
data/raw/gnn_model.pt
data/cache.db

# ── Source CSV Files (you provide these separately) ───────────────────────────
data/raw/data_part1_800k.csv
data/raw/data_part2_405k.csv

# ── Graph + Mapping Files (generated by main.py) ──────────────────────────────
# NOTE: graph.pt, node_mapping.csv, node_positions.json, feature_names.txt
# are small enough to optionally commit, but keeping them generated is cleaner.
# Uncomment below to exclude them:
# data/raw/graph.pt
# data/raw/node_mapping.csv
# data/raw/node_positions.json
# data/raw/feature_names.txt

# ── Simulation Outputs (generated by Person 2 / Person 3) ────────────────────
data/raw/gnn_labels.csv
data/raw/mc_results.csv
data/raw/systemic_risk_metrics.json

# ── Exported PDF Reports ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
reports/exports/

# ── Python Cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.so

# ── Test / Coverage ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# ── Virtual Environments / Conda ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.conda/
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# ── IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Jupyter (if used for exploration) ────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
!data/security/.gitkeep
